{"id":2674,"date":"2026-06-10T11:36:09","date_gmt":"2026-06-10T11:36:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2674"},"modified":"2026-10-02T10:06:14","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T10:06:14","slug":"kota-green-polish-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-green-polish-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Kota Green Polish Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"646\">Kota Green Polish is a premium natural stone known for its rich green appearance and smooth polished finish that enhances the stone&#8217;s natural beauty. The polished surface highlights the unique characteristics of Kota stone, creating a sophisticated and elegant look suitable for a wide range of architectural and interior applications.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"973\">Widely preferred by architects, builders, interior designers, and homeowners, Kota Green Polish complements both contemporary and traditional spaces. Its refined appearance makes it an excellent choice for residential, commercial, hospitality, and institutional projects where durability and aesthetics are equally important.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1211\">The stone is valued for its strength, longevity, and low maintenance requirements, making it a practical solution for high-traffic areas. Its natural green tones add warmth and character while maintaining a clean and premium appearance.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1424\">Combining timeless beauty with reliable performance, Kota Green Polish remains one of the most sought-after natural stones for creating elegant interiors and exteriors that retain their appeal for years to come.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1429\" \/>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11k4bfl\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1456\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1456\">Product Attributes<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"